### 2. MONITORES  ->  /usuarios/monitores
### =====================================================================

### 2.1 Cadastrar monitor (sucesso) - esperado: 201 Created
POST {{host}}/usuarios/monitores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Carlos Monitor",
  "email": "carlos.monitor@ecodog.com",
  "cpf": "11144477735",
  "telefone": "11966665555",
  "senha": "senha123"
}

### 2.2 Cadastrar monitor - e-mail já cadastrado - esperado: 409 Conflict
POST {{host}}/usuarios/monitores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Outro Monitor",
  "email": "carlos.monitor@ecodog.com",
  "cpf": "12345678909",
  "telefone": "11955554444",
  "senha": "senha123"
}

### 2.3 Cadastrar monitor - CPF já cadastrado - esperado: 409 Conflict
POST {{host}}/usuarios/monitores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Monitor Duplicado",
  "email": "duplicado@ecodog.com",
  "cpf": "11144477735",
  "telefone": "11944443333",
  "senha": "senha123"
}

