POST {{host}}/usuarios/monitores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "",
  "email": "invalido",
  "cpf": "00000000000",
  "telefone": "",
  "senha": "123"
}

### 2.5 Listar monitores - esperado: 200 OK (ou 204 se vazio)
